sentences.text:
The essential  ingredients of the offence under Section 498A are  as follows:-
 (1) A woman was married;
 (2) She was subjected to cruelty;
 (3) Such cruelty consisted in --  3  (i) Any willful conduct as was likely to drive  such woman to commit suicide or to cause  grave injury or danger to her life, limb or  health whether mental or physical.
